      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A small but important side note though is we really need a way to *know what elements people have hidden on us*. It is going to be incredibly confusing to have to mentally keep track of who can and can't see what, especially if they have their limits set to something extremely strict like Good or Very Good rank. Perhaps this information could be displayed on a player's Quick Menu information (when you select a player while in your Quick Menu)?",
