      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I hate how the current system analyzes all the disabled objects in the worst possible sceneario. Say you have 10 props you activate individually with each hand gesture. Obviously you can only have 2 active at once at most yet vrchat considers you have 10 activate at the same time making it extremely unfair as an avatar ranking evaluation",
